<title>UGANDA: Uganda shilling unchanged against dollar.</title>
<headline>Uganda shilling unchanged against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>KAMPALA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ugandan shilling held steady against the dollar on Wednesday, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The shilling was posted at a mean rate of 1075 against the dollar, flat from Tuesday. Against the pound, it was posted at mean rate 1730, also unchanged from Tuesday.</p>
</text>
